+// the console's near/far cull range for a fixed function draw on untransformed vertices, in depth buffer units: the
+// library programs it from the viewport's MinZ and MaxZ (not 0 to zscale, as for vertex programs), so a title that
+// maps a GL style depth range into MinZ -1 draws what lands below 0. False when it is 0 to zscale.
+bool FixedDepthCullRange(const State& s, float& lo, float& hi);
 void FillLightConstants(const State& s, const FixedKey& fk, DrawConstants& c);
 
